      {
        "id": 17158,
        "title": "Atualizando Variáveis Let",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145163,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Já vimos que variáveis <code>let</code>, ao contrário de <code>const</code>, podem mudar e atualizar os valores que armazenam.</p><p>Use o sinal <code>=</code> para mudar o valor em <code>playerState</code> de <code>\"Idle\"</code> para <code>\"Running\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145164,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos atualizar variáveis <code>let</code> quantas vezes quisermos.</p><p>Tente você mesmo: altere o valor de <code>playerState</code> para <code>\"Jumping\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jumping&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>playerState</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>\"Jumping\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145165,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Também podemos atribuir aos variáveis os valores de outras variáveis, definindo uma variável para a outra.</p><p>Atribua à variável <code>playerState</code> o valor de <code>defaultState</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;GameOver&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"85\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" defaultState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;GameOver&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = defaultState;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>defaultState</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145166,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando atualizamos uma variável, ela esquece seu valor anterior.</p><p>Exiba a variável <code>playerState</code> quando ela estiver definida como <code>\"Attacking\"</code> e quando estiver definida como <code>\"Defending\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let playerState\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Attacking&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Defending&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>playerState</code> seguido de <code>playerState</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145167,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual dessas linhas de código atualiza a variável <code>playerHealth</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>playerHealth = 50;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let playerHealth = 50;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>playerHealth = 50;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145168,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Forest</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>levelName</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>Forest</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145169,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Falta a palavra-chave <code>let</code> na primeira linha</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nada</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Falta a palavra-chave <code>let</code> na primeira linha.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145170,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Joe</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Lori</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>Joe</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145171,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Altere o valor na variável <code>playerHealth</code> para <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let playerHealth\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>playerHealth</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145172,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atualize a variável <code>gameState</code> para <code>\"Paused\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let gameState\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(gameState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>gameState</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e depois <code>\"Paused\"</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atualize a variável <code>hudText</code> para <code>\"Start\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Start\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let hudText\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hudText = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Press any key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hudText = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Start&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hudText);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>hudText</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e depois <code>\"Start\"</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Altere o valor da variável <code>gameState</code> para <code>\"GameOver\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"49\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;GameOver&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(gameState);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"GameOver\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17159,
        "title": "Expressões de String",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145175,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos adicionar valores de string juntos com um sinal de <code>+</code>.</p><p>Adicione os valores <code>\"Score:\"</code> e <code>\"55\"</code> juntos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nós chamamos a adição de valores de string de uma <strong>expressão</strong> porque ela cria um único valor de string.</p><p>Adicione a expressão entre os parênteses de <code>console.log()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"Score:\"</code> seguido de <code>+</code> e finalmente <code>\"55\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando expressões contêm variáveis, elas usam os valores nas variáveis.</p><p>Crie uma expressão que adicione o valor <code>\"HP:\"</code> e a variável <code>playerHealth</code> juntos.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"47\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerHealth;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"HP:\"</code> seguido de <code>+</code> e finalmente <code>playerHealth</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145178,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar <code>console.log()</code> para ver os resultados de expressões.</p><p>Adicione uma instrução <code>console.log()</code> em torno da expressão.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>console.log</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145179,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como expressões se tornam valores, podemos atribuí-las a variáveis assim como fazemos com valores.</p><p>Armazene a expressão <code>\"Level:\" + \"13\"</code> na variável <code>label</code> e exiba-a no console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;13&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(label);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"Level:\"</code> seguido de <code>+</code> e depois <code>\"13\"</code>, <code>label</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145180,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o valor de <code>label</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Rex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Player:Rex\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Rex\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"Player:Rex\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145181,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Nada, porque não há instrução <code>console.log()</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>GameOver</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nada, porque não há instrução <code>console.log()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145182,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + enemyName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Enemy:slime</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>slime</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>Enemy:slime</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145183,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que este código exibe <code>GameStart</code> sem um espaço no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Start&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Porque <code>\"Game\" + \"Start\"</code> adiciona os valores juntos sem um espaço</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Porque <code>console.log()</code> nunca exibe espaços</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque <code>\"Game\" + \"Start\"</code> adiciona os valores juntos sem um espaço.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145184,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione a variável <code>score</code> à expressão.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;score&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"&quot;14&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score + \" /><text value=\"&quot; points&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145185,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Exiba <code>Score:55</code> no console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>console.log</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>\"Score:\" + \"55\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145186,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Exiba <code>Level 3</code> no console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number = \" /><text value=\"&quot;3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(label + number);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>label</code> seguido de <code>+</code> e finalmente <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145187,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique o valor da string <code>\"coins\"</code> para ver quantas moedas temos.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"56\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coinCount = \" /><text value=\"&quot;40 &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coinCount + \" /><text value=\"&quot;coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"coins\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17160,
        "title": "Números",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145188,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Existem outros tipos de valores também. Como <strong>números</strong>, que não têm aspas duplas ao redor deles.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;5&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145189,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Números facilitam o acompanhamento de <strong>valores numéricos</strong>. Por exemplo, a pontuação do jogador em um jogo.</p><p>Crie uma variável <code>playerScore</code> e defina-a como <code>5</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerScore);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const</code> seguido de <code>playerScore</code> e depois <code>=</code>, <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145190,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos criar expressões com números também. Adicionamos números juntos com o sinal <code>+</code> e subtraímos uns dos outros com o sinal <code>-</code>.</p><p>Exiba <code>6</code> no console definindo <code>playerScore</code> como <code>5 + 1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerScore);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>+</code> seguido de <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145191,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usamos o sinal <code>*</code> para multiplicar números e o sinal <code>/</code> para dividir números.</p><p>Transforme <code>0.5</code> em uma porcentagem para um valor de chance crítica multiplicando-o por <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"x\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" critChancePercent = \" /><text value=\"0.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(critChancePercent);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>*</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145192,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando armazenamos números em variáveis, podemos usar as variáveis para cálculos também.</p><p>Adicione <code>1</code> à variável <code>currentLevel</code> antes de exibi-la no console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentLevel = \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Next level is:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(currentLevel + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>+</code> seguido de <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145193,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como expressões se tornam valores, podemos armazenar resultados de cálculos em variáveis.</p><p>Armazene o resultado do cálculo na variável <code>total</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"92\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coinsPickedUp = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coinsInChest = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = coinsPickedUp + coinsInChest;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Total coins: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + total);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>total</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>coinsPickedUp + coinsInChest</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145194,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o valor da variável <code>enemySpeed</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemySpeed = \" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>305</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>300</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>305</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145195,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que este código exibe <code>31</code> em vez de <code>4</code> no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelLabel = \" /><text value=\"&quot;3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelLabel);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque <code>\"3\"</code> e <code>\"1\"</code> são valores de string</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque a expressão subtrai os números</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque <code>\"3\"</code> e <code>\"1\"</code> são valores de string.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145196,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como sabemos que a variável <code>score</code> armazena um número?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque não há aspas duplas em torno de <code>40</code> e <code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque <code>score</code> parece que armazena um número</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque não há aspas duplas em torno de <code>40</code> e <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145197,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" collisionFormula = \" /><text value=\"&quot;3 * 5&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(collisionFormula);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3 * 5</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>15</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3 * 5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145198,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Multiplique a variável <code>damage</code> pela variável <code>criticalMultiplier</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"92\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" criticalMultiplier = \" /><text value=\"0.04\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(damage * criticalMultiplier);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>*</code> seguido de <code>criticalMultiplier</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145199,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Divida <code>totalXP</code> por <code>enemiesDefeated</code> para obter a média de XP por inimigo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"÷\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalXP = \" /><text value=\"460\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemiesDefeated = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalXP / enemiesDefeated);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>/</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145200,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Subtraia <code>damageTaken</code> de <code>health</code> e exiba o resultado do cálculo no console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"109\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damageTaken = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health after hit:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(health - damageTaken);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>health</code> seguido de <code>-</code> e finalmente <code>damageTaken</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145201,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Defina <code>maxLives</code> para <code>12</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"19\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" maxLives = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(maxLives);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>12</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
